The default fan settings for the Orange Pi 5 Pro are safely set to avoid potential component 
damage that may occur when using most common or aggressive fans with higher watts. 
However, this overlay allow set them back to the PWM defaults, which is useful and even required when 
using some low power high tech fans (like Sunon Vapo-Bearing). This overlay also sets the cooling 
duty cycle a bit higher, as these fans have less cooling power and also make quiet fans quieter. (The fan design is counter-intuitive.)
